      "heading": "Climate seasonality and health of older adults in rural Busia and Kilifi, Kenya: SENIORS study",
      "body": "Shumba CS et al.\n\nBMJ Open · 15(10), e103956"
    },
    {
      "heading": "Ten new insights in climate science 2024",
      "body": "Schaeffer R et al.\n\nOne Earth · 8(6)"
    },
    {
